## 📦 SUBTAREA 1: Base de Datos y Entidades JPA


### 1.1 — Crear entidad `MaterialSpent`


```java /src/main/java/com/example/domain/entity/MaterialSpent.java
@Entity
@Table(name = "material_spent")
public class MaterialSpent {


    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;


    @Column(name = "quantity", nullable = false, precision = 10, scale = 2)
    private BigDecimal quantity; // Por defecto 1.00, decimal


    @Column(name = "part_number", nullable = true, length = 100)
    private String partNumber; // Código/Part Number, opcional


    @Column(name = "description", nullable = false, length = 500)
    private String description; // Obligatoria


    @ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY)
    @JoinColumn(name = "daily_workload_line_id", nullable = false)
    private DailyWorkloadLine dailyWorkloadLine;


